    lines.push('');
    lines.push('## 浣犵殑浠诲姟');
    lines.push('');
    lines.push('璇锋牴鎹笂杩?CETA 椤圭洰鐨?Seed Data 淇℃伅锛岀敓鎴愪竴浠?*瀹屾暣鐨?API 浣跨敤鏂囨。**锛岃姹傦細');
    lines.push('');
    lines.push('### 1. API 绔偣鍒楄〃');
    lines.push('');
    lines.push('鏍规嵁琛ㄥ崟瀹炰綋鍜岄〉闈㈤厤缃紝鎺ㄦ柇骞跺垪鍑烘墍鏈夊彲鑳界殑 API 绔偣锛屽寘鎷細');
    lines.push('');
    lines.push('- **CRUD 鎿嶄綔**: 姣忎釜琛ㄥ崟瀹炰綋鐨勫鍒犳敼鏌ユ帴鍙?);
    lines.push('  - `POST /form/api/v2/form-entity-data/{pbcToken}/{formEntityToken}/default` - 鍒涘缓璁板綍');
    lines.push('  - `GET /form/api/v2/form-entity-data/{pbcToken}/{formEntityToken}/{id}` - 鑾峰彇鍗曟潯璁板綍');
    lines.push('  - `PUT /form/api/v2/form-entity-data/{pbcToken}/{formEntityToken}/{id}` - 鏇存柊璁板綍');
