    lines.push('');
    lines.push('- **椤甸潰閰嶇疆鎺ュ彛**: 鑾峰彇鍒楄〃椤点€佽鎯呴〉鐨勯厤缃?);
    lines.push('  - `GET /form/api/form-entity-page/get-by-schema-id/{pbcToken}/{schemaId}`');
    lines.push('');
    lines.push('- **娴佺▼鎺ュ彛**: 娴佺▼瀹氫箟銆佹祦绋嬪疄渚嬬浉鍏虫帴鍙?);
    lines.push('  - `GET /flow/api/flow-definition/{id}`');
    lines.push('  - `POST /flow/api/flow-instance/start`');
    lines.push('');
    lines.push('### 2. 璇锋眰鍙傛暟璇﹁В');
    lines.push('');
    lines.push('瀵逛簬姣忎釜 API锛岃缁嗚鏄庯細');
    lines.push('');
